  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>*V1.1.0：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HTbxUF_y7-U?si=S7c34HiJye_YZ52V\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><em><strong>評論：(舊版)</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe style=\"width:555px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sZLTj3Fv2Do?wmode=transparent\" width=\"555\" height=\"323\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">歡迎來到《傳奇怪物的武器》</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">-本模組為傳奇怪物的武器添加了大量招式，戰鬥並化身為<strong>怪物</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>-</strong>不僅有多樣化的招式，透過組合它們，你將獲得&nbsp;<strong>其他</strong>招式，讓戰鬥體驗更加豐富有趣...</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">V1.1.0：&nbsp;</span></strong>新增了<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Tesseract</span></strong>（作為 Epic Fight 能力），以及<strong>華麗複雜的連招/技能</strong></p>\n<p><em>未來計畫：專案尚未放棄，「只是作者本人目前較少時間開發....」。《傳奇怪物的武器》後續將加入源自<strong>《Epic Fight - Invincible》</strong>的招式...。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>必備模組：</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>Epic Fight</strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod</a></p>\n<p><strong>神蹟之武</strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-invincible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>P1nero 的 Epic Fight - Invincible</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>傳奇怪物</strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-monsters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-monsters</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>祝遊得愉快！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>立即加入我們的 Discord！</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1169738/description_cadee3d6-9dc2-4558-9089-b016f0690a37.png\" width=\"173\" height=\"173\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
